{"title": "Sacred Munitions", "pageid": 27364, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sacred_Munitions", "categories": ["Weapon actions", "Bonus actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Sacred_Munitions.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Sacred_Munitions.webp/300px-Sacred_Munitions.webp, /w/images/4/48/Sacred_Munitions.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Sacred_Munitions.webp/300px-Sacred_Munitions.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/48/Sacred_Munitions.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b> Sacred Munitions </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon action\">weapon action</a> granted by <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gandrel%27s_Aspiration\" title=\"Gandrel's Aspiration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gandrel%27s_Aspiration\" title=\"Gandrel's Aspiration\">Gandrel's Aspiration</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nInfuse your crossbow bolts with holy energy. For the rest of your turn, your ranged weapon attacks inflict <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Turned_(Condition)\" title=\"Turned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Turned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Turned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Turned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Turned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Turned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Turned_(Condition)\" title=\"Turned (Condition)\">Turned</a> against <a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">undead</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_MAG_WeaponAction_UndeadTurningBolt</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_MAG_WeaponAction_UndeadTurningBolt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_MAG_WeaponAction_UndeadTurningBolt\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=IsDefaultWeaponAction_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"IsDefaultWeaponAction (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">IsDefaultWeaponAction</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Sacred_Munitions\"> Condition: Sacred Munitions </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sacred_Munitions_(Condition)\" title=\"Sacred Munitions (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sacred Munitions\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sacred_Munitions_(Condition)\" title=\"Sacred Munitions (Condition)\">Sacred Munitions</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity's ranged weapon attacks possibly inflict <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Turn_Undead\" title=\"Turn Undead\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Turn_Undead_Icon.webp/25px-Turn_Undead_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Turn_Undead_Icon.webp/38px-Turn_Undead_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Turn_Undead_Icon.webp/50px-Turn_Undead_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Turn Undead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Turn_Undead_Icon.webp/25px-Turn_Undead_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Turn_Undead_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Turn_Undead\" title=\"Turn Undead\">Turn Undead</a> on a target.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Turned\"> Condition: Turned </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Turned_(Condition)\" title=\"Turned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Turned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Turned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Turned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Turned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Turned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Turned_(Condition)\" title=\"Turned (Condition)\">Turned</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 3  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>A turned creature must spend its turns trying to move as far away from the creature which turned it as possible.</li>\n<li>It cannot willingly move to a space within 9 m (30 ft) of that creature.</li>\n<li>It also cannot take <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reactions</a>.</li>\n<li>For its <a href=\"/wiki/Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Action\">Actions</a>, it can use only the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/25px-Dash_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/38px-Dash_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/50px-Dash_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/25px-Dash_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\">Dash</a> action or try to escape from an effect that prevents it from moving.</li>\n<li><b>The condition ends upon taking damage.</b></li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gandrel%27s_Aspiration\" title=\"Gandrel's Aspiration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Gandrel%27s_Aspiration\" title=\"Gandrel's Aspiration\">Gandrel's Aspiration</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The in-game description says \"Your ranged weapon attacks <i>possibly</i> inflict Turn Undead,\" but there is actually no saving throw to resist it.</li>\n<li>A level 5 cleric using this feature will also have the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Destroy_Undead\" title=\"Destroy Undead\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Destroy_Undead_Icon.webp/20px-Destroy_Undead_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Destroy_Undead_Icon.webp/30px-Destroy_Undead_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Destroy_Undead_Icon.webp/40px-Destroy_Undead_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Destroy Undead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Destroy_Undead_Icon.webp/20px-Destroy_Undead_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a7/Destroy_Undead_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Destroy_Undead\" title=\"Destroy Undead\">Destroy Undead</a> feature applied to their ranged attacks, dealing <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">4d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">Radiant</span></a> bonus damage to undead targets.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Visuals\"> Visuals </span></h2>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><div class=\"embedvideo-wrapper embedvideo--local-embed-style\" style=\"position: relative;\"><div class=\"embedvideo-localEmbedStyle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"embedvideo-overlay\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__fakeButton\">Play Video</div><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__footer\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__service\">Local File</div></div></div></div></div><video src=\"https://bg3.wiki/w/images/1/1d/Sacred_Munitions_Action.mp4\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 640px; height: auto;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Sacred_Munitions_Action.mp4\">https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Sacred_Munitions_Action.mp4</a></video></div></span> \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715040359\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.098 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.104 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4292/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 59408/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 22845/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 36/1000\nLua time usage: 0.034/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1550554/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n110.11%   97.821     57 Template:Trim\n100.00%   88.836      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   88.836      1 -total\n 16.00%   14.215      2 Template:Condition\n 13.31%   11.822  